# Production build config (loaded automatically by `vite build`).
# Not a secret — this is a public URL, not a credential.
#
# The production web bundle is served by the FastAPI backend on the SAME origin
# (https://valam-ai.onrender.com), so leave VITE_API_BASE_URL unset here: the
# client calls relative /api/v1 paths and needs no CORS preflight. Set it only
# for a split-origin web deployment or a native shell:
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.valam.in
#
# The Capacitor/Android bundle needs an explicit cross-origin API URL, so it
# builds with --mode capacitor and reads frontend/.env.capacitor instead.
